      <message>feat: add container runtime abstraction for docker/podman support

- Add ContainerRuntime interface and DockerRuntime implementation
- Support both docker and podman via CONTAINER_RUNTIME env config
- Add containerRuntime to application config with docker as default
- Update docker handler to use configurable container runtime
- Update checkDocker and checkDockerRunning to support both runtimes

fix: improve HMAC verification for DELETE requests
- Add DELETE method to bodyless methods in HMAC verification
- DELETE requests no longer incorrectly handled as body-containing requests

fix: improve command stream handling
- Refactor sendCommandToContainer stream handling for better error management
- Add debug logging for container running state and command execution
- Use stream.write/end pattern for more reliable command delivery

fix: enhance websocket command extraction
- Prioritize msg.command field from panel for better compatibility
- Fall back to other fields for backwards compatibility
- Add fallback field check first before checking candidates

chore: add debug logging to websocket message handling
- Log incoming websocket messages for debugging
- Track parsed events and authentication state
- Monitor command event routing</message>
