      <message>feat: add backup upload endpoint and improve backup API security

- Add new POST /container/backup/upload endpoint for uploading container backups
- Refactor backup API to use full backup paths instead of backup IDs for improved security
  and path validation (prevents potential path traversal attacks)
- Rename backup-related variables for better clarity:
  * backupId → backupUuid (semantic clarity)
  * fileName → backupFileName (consistency)
- Improve backup response structure with timestamps and standardized format
- Capitalize success messages for consistency (&apos;backup created&apos; → &apos;Backup created&apos;)
- Add REQUIRE_HMAC=false environment variable support to allow unsigned requests during dev/testing
- Update HMAC verification to gracefully handle unsigned requests when disabled
- Bump bun dependency from ^1.3.12 to ^1.3.13
- Remove .instructions.md file
- Add basename import to instances.ts for proper filename extraction

This improves the security posture of backup operations by validating the full
backup path against the allowed backups directory, preventing unauthorized access
to files outside the backup storage location.

Known issues: sending commands from panel not working, stop and restart not working</message>
